        }
      ],
      "content": "MARLOWES 1. 5252 TL 0507 1/201                                     Nos 83 and 85 II                       GV 2. Early C19.  Yellow brick, hipped Welsh slated roof with eaves cornice.  2 storeys and basement, 1st floor stucco sill band.  Central block has 2 sash windows, glazing bars on left, altered 2 light window on right.  Ground floor sash window on left, canted bay window on right with wooden balustrade to flat roof.  Recessed. wings each have arched doorway with traceried fanlight, 1st floor circular window with radiating glazing bars. Nos 75 to 85 (odd) form a group. Listing NGR: TL0556607184"
    }
